OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA largely fine and dry day.
OL,6,FOccasional sunny spells are likely,
OL,7,Fespecially at first, although some
OL,8,Fcloud will build through the day.
OL,9,FLight winds, breezy along the coast.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA dry and settled night, any
OL,12,Fcloud will give way with clearing
OL,13,Fskies across the region. Winds light
OL,14,Fand variable.
OL,15,
OL,16,CSaturday:FClear skies at first
OL,17,Fbecoming cloudy during the afternoon,
OL,18,Fthough sunny spells are likely. Winds
OL,19,Flight and variable. Feeling hot.
